Notebook[{Cell["FormSlotLabels", "ObjectName"], 
  Cell["FormSlotLabels is an option of FormSlotTable and the model views: an \
association from form-slot IDs to label strings or TeXFragment values.", 
   "Usage"], Cell["Status: Alpha.", "Notes"], Cell["Option of FormSlotTable \
and the model views (ModelView, FieldTable, ContractionTable, CouplingTable, \
MassMatrixView, ModelOutputView): custom labels by form-slot ID.", "Notes"], 
  Cell["Default <||>; slot labels otherwise come from the slot records \
(Y^(k)_r with a Roman copy index when the space has more than one copy); \
unknown slot IDs fail InvalidOption.", "Notes"], 
